  - DIRECT
- name: 🐟 Final
  type: select
  proxies:
  - 🚀 Proxy
  - 🎯 Direct
  - REJECT
- name: 🌍 All Auto
  type: url-test
  url: https://www.gstatic.com/generate_204
  interval: 600
  lazy: true
  tolerance: 180
  proxies:
  - REJECT
  include-all: true
  filter: (?i)^((🇺🇸|🇹🇼|🇯🇵|🇸🇬|🇭🇰|🇬🇧|🇩🇪|🇦🇺)\s*)?(\[(vless|hy2|hysteria|hysteria2|hysteria
    2|hysteria-2)\]\s*)?((🇺🇸|🇹🇼|🇯🇵|🇸🇬|🇭🇰|🇬🇧|🇩🇪|🇦🇺)\s*)?(US|USA|United States|UnitedStates|America|美国|美國|Los
    Angeles|LosAngeles|San Jose|SanJose|Seattle|New York|NewYork|TW|TWN|Taiwan|台湾|台灣|Taipei|台北|JP|JPN|Japan|日本|Tokyo|东京|東京|Osaka|大阪|SG|SGP|Singapore|新加坡|狮城|獅城|HK|HKG|Hong
    Kong|HongKong|香港|UK|GB|GBR|United Kingdom|UnitedKingdom|Britain|英国|英國|London|伦敦|倫敦|DE|DEU|Germany|Deutschland|德国|德國|Frankfurt|法兰克福|法蘭克福|AU|AUS|Australia|澳大利亚|澳大利亞|澳洲|Sydney|悉尼|雪梨)(\s|-|_)+(Extreme|Prestige|Ultimate|Ultiamte|Max|Dynamic|HY2|IPv6|[0-9]).*$
- name: 🇺🇸 US Auto
  type: url-test
  url: https://www.gstatic.com/generate_204
  interval: 600
  lazy: true
  tolerance: 180
  proxies:
  - REJECT
  include-all: true
  filter: (?i)^((🇺🇸)\s*)?(\[(vless|hy2|hysteria|hysteria2|hysteria 2|hysteria-2)\]\s*)?((🇺🇸)\s*)?(US|USA|United
    States|UnitedStates|America|美国|美國|Los Angeles|LosAngeles|San Jose|SanJose|Seattle|New
    York|NewYork)(\s|-|_)+(Extreme|Prestige|Ultimate|Ultiamte|Max|Dynamic|HY2|IPv6|[0-9]).*$
- name: 🇺🇸 US Nodes
  type: select
  proxies:
  - 🇺🇸 US Auto
  - REJECT
  include-all: true
  filter: (?i)^((🇺🇸)\s*)?(\[(vless|hy2|hysteria|hysteria2|hysteria 2|hysteria-2)\]\s*)?((🇺🇸)\s*)?(US|USA|United
    States|UnitedStates|America|美国|美國|Los Angeles|LosAngeles|San Jose|SanJose|Seattle|New
    York|NewYork)(\s|-|_)+(Extreme|Prestige|Ultimate|Ultiamte|Max|Dynamic|HY2|IPv6|[0-9]).*$
