- RULE-SET,LocalAreaNetwork,DIRECT
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bankofchina.com,DIRECT
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,unionpay.com,DIRECT
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,niu.com,DIRECT
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,niucache.com,DIRECT
